      "sourceLink": null,
      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "Bumping this up as it's still an issue and there is still no notification on either end for requests to join that meet this condition.\n\nI'll add that the user should probably receive a notification back when the group tries and fails to accept their invite rather than requesting since there are situations where the group cap for users can change such as an expiring vrc+ subscription.",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    },
